{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":6},"Etre plutôt qu'avoir : à l'école autrement","D’où vient l’école, sur quel principe a-t-elle été construite, autour de quelles idées et de quelles valeurs ? Quels citoyens notre société forme-t-elle pour demain, et quelles alternatives pourrait-on souhaiter pour mieux répondre aux enjeux à venir ? Ce sont toutes ces questions que le film aborde, car, comme le disait Nelson Mandela, l’éducation est l’arme la plus puissante pour changer le monde...",[4,5],"self-employment","education",{"type":7,"id":8,"slug":9,"title":10,"release":12,"filmType":16,"directors":17,"genre":26,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":56,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_016","fr2018-016-etre-plutot-qu-avoir-a-l-ecole-autrement",{"native":1,"english":11},"",{"type":13,"date":14,"year":15},"Theatrical release","2018-01-31",2018,"Documentary",[18],{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Agnès Fouilleux","agnes-fouilleux",1952,0,"Female identifying","France",[],[27,28],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/206/215/186318/format_page/etre-plutot-qu-avoir-a-l-ecole-autrement.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eEe0aSJNy-c",{"native":2,"english":11},[34],{"country":24,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38,42,49],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":19,"slug":20,"name":19,"birthYear":21,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",{"person":43,"role":48},{"id":44,"slug":45,"name":44,"birthYear":46,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":47},"Isabelle Filliozat","isabelle-filliozat",1957,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":50,"role":48},{"id":51,"slug":52,"name":51,"birthYear":53,"deathYear":22,"gender":54,"nationality":24,"awards":55},"Philippe Meirieu","philippe-meirie